# Pack work

- Apply `governance/07-pack-standard.md` and `05-risk-model.md`.
- Keep `pack.md` and `pack.json` consistent.
- Use stable `OUT-*`, `AC-*`, and `NFR-*` identifiers.
- Separate facts, assumptions, decisions, open questions, in scope and out of scope.
- Include baseline, target, data source, validation window, rollout and rollback.
- Run `pwsh ./scripts/validate-pack.ps1 -Path <outcome-folder>`.
